        "explicit choice": 102.82199893188476
      },
      "start": 91.702,
      "end": 104.3,
      "audio_start": 91.952,
      "audio_end": 103.822
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "heading": "Useful organization. Your control.",
      "text": "Every model call has a reviewed budget: count, reserve, generate, record. Find the repository you need. Understand why it belongs. Keep the final decision yours.",
